{"title":"Conference Report and Intelligence Briefing: ACAH/ACCS/ACSS2026","link":"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-acah-accs-acss2026/","date":1788936762000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TDV05551-1500-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"ACAH/ACCS/ACSS2026 Conference Report\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TDV05551-1500-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TDV05551-1500-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TDV05551-1500-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TDV05551-1500-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TDV05551-1500-300x300.jpg 300w\" />The ACAH/ACCS/ACSS2026 conference held in Tokyo from May 9-13, 2026, gathered 657 attendees from 60 countries and 433 affiliations to discuss how to address challenges that society is facing today. The plenary sessions discussed the issue of an ageing society, employability, innovation, and leadership. They focused on how to equip learners, citizens, and future leaders <a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-acah-accs-acss2026/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-and-intelligence-briefing-acah-accs-acss2026/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"d3f6e9cb0a18e03af068d9eaee40c81c920a305f0451893dd45dc0f65e9d860e","category":"Interdisciplinary"}